('listed',('亚太区上市集团 · 项目上线','Listed Asia-Pacific group · Product launch'),('定位经营缺口 · 推进上线','Identified operating gaps · Advanced launch'),('识别项目、团队、版本及资源缺口，梳理上线优先级。客户反馈上线后取得稳定月度业务规模。','Identified product, team, release and resource gaps, then set launch priorities. The client reported a stable monthly business scale after launch.'),'AI商业化BP · P16'),
